# PushpAmal Example: Prime Number Sieve
# Demonstrates: Loop, conditional, memory operations
# Note: In PushpAmal, "prime" may or may not be prime, depending on the moon cycle

push 2
push 2
push 2
label_start:
push 2
push 2
mod
push 2
jz label_end
push 2
push 2
div
push 2
push 2
add
print
